<h1>Journey Time Tool</h1>

<p>This is a simple web tool created by researchers at the Active Travel Academy, University of Westminster. It allows transport practitioners collect data on the duration of local car trips, before and after an intervention. Use is free but registration is required. If you would like to register to use to tool, please contact us at <a href="mailto:activetravelacademy@westminster.ac.uk">activetravelacademy@westminster.ac.uk</a>.</p>

<h2>Log in</h2>

<%= simple_form_for(resource, as: resource_name, url: session_path(resource_name)) do |f| %>
  <div class="form-inputs">
    <%= f.input :email,
                required: false,
                autofocus: true,
                input_html: { autocomplete: "email" } %>
    <%= f.input :password,
                required: false,
                input_html: { autocomplete: "current-password" } %>
    <%= f.input :remember_me, as: :boolean if devise_mapping.rememberable? %>
  </div>

  <div class="form-actions">
    <%= f.button :submit, "Log in" %>
  </div>
<% end %>

<%= render "devise/shared/links" %>
